    "final_answer": "I now have comprehensive data on all pizza restaurants near 30309. Let me compile the results.\n\nBased on my search of Google Maps for \"pizza 30309\" (the zip code is in Atlanta, GA), here are 5 pizza restaurants ranked by their ratings:\n\n## Top 5 Pizza Restaurants Near 30309 (Ranked by Rating)\n\n| Rank | Restaurant | Rating | Reviews | Price Range | Address |\n|------|------------|--------|---------|-------------|---------|\n| 1 | **Varasano's Pizzeria - Buckhead** | ⭐ 4.9 | 3,166 | $20-30 | 2171 Peachtree Rd NE Unit 100 |\n| 2 | **Tandoori Pizza & Wing Co** | ⭐ 4.7 | 853 | $10-20 | 1175 Peachtree St NE Ste 160 |\n| 3 | **Antico Pizza Napoletana** | ⭐ 4.6 | 6,556 | $20-30 | 1093 Hemphill Ave NW |\n| 4 | **Varuni Napoli** | ⭐ 4.6 | 1,506 | $10-40 | 1540 Monroe Dr NE |\n| 5 | **Atwoods Pizza Cafe** | ⭐ 4.5 | 1,111 | $10-20 | 817 W Peachtree St NW Ste A105 |\n\n**Notes:**\n- All listed restaurants are tagged as pizza restaurants (\"披萨店\"/pizza) on Google Maps.\n- Varasano's Pizzeria is the clear top-rated with a 4.9 rating across 3,166 reviews.\n- Antico Pizza Napoletana has the highest review count (6,556) of the group.\n- There were several additional restaurants tied at 4.5 stars that I didn't include in the top 5: Night Owl Pizza - Midtown (1,329 reviews), Ray's New York Pizza (1,371 reviews), Fellini's Pizza (3,352 reviews), and Emmy Squared Pizza: West Midtown (776 reviews). I selected Atwoods Pizza Cafe as the #5 entry since it appears most prominently in the search results.\n\nThe task has been completed successfully.",
